@startuml
actor User
participant API
queue Queue
participant Worker
database DB

User -> API: Start job
API -> DB: Create job record
API -> Queue: Enqueue(jobId)
API --> User: Accepted(jobId)

Worker -> Queue: Dequeue(jobId)
Worker -> DB: Load job
Worker -> DB: Persist progress/result
Worker --> Queue: Ack
@enduml
